& [Problem] is a verified MCP server without a preserved Codex operator transition

& [Decision] is to prove the exact future launch path and publish a reversible runbook while withholding configuration mutation

& [Value] is reviewable activation without conflating technical readiness with trust authorization

& [Alternative] direct config editing is rejected because the CLI provides a stable named transition and removal surface

& [Deferred] is the operator decision to register and restart Codex
